      "body": "### Preflight Checklist\n\n- [X] I have read the [Contributing Guidelines](https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) for this project.\n- [X] I agree to follow the [Code of Conduct](https://github.com/electron/electron/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md) that this project adheres to.\n- [X] I have searched the [issue tracker](https://www.github.com/electron/electron/issues) for a feature request that matches the one I want to file, without success.\n\n### Problem Description\n\n- I'm trying to make a browser window on the `macOS`, but I don't want to make it visible on `the application windows list`.\r\n- On `Windows OS`, I'm using the perfect below options that did the job, and clicking on `Alt + Tab` will not show the window to the list of windows, while the same options on macOS will add the browser window to `the application windows list` via clicking on `F3` key.\r\n\r\n```js\r\n        focusable: false,\r\n        transparent: true,\r\n        alwaysOnTop: true,\r\n        skipTaskbar: true,\r\n        frame: false,\r\n```\n\n### Proposed Solution\n\nProviding options for the browser window on `macOS` to prevent adding it to `the application windows list` as `Window OS`.\n\n### Alternatives Considered\n\nAny alternative options from your side will be appreciated if there.\r\nThanks in advance!\n\n### Additional Information\n\n_No response_",
